{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"tense-evenhanded-kestrel","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`docs/plan-review-gate.md:795` makes a blanket claim-denial statement, contradicting the bug exemption in `src/rebar/_commands/gates.py:45` and the guide's own exception at lines 474 and 1477. The approved clarification is sequence-sensitive.\n\n## Approach\n\nCorrect the maintained guide directly. State that a bug may be claimed without plan review to perform root-cause analysis; after RCA, a complex bug with an implementation plan and file impact must receive LLM plan review before remediation begins. Preserve behavioral code/tests as authority.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `docs/plan-review-gate.md`\n- `src/rebar/_commands/gates.py` and `tests/unit/test_bug_review_tier.py` as behavior evidence/checks\n\n## Testing\n\nRun focused bug-review tier tests and add/update a documentation assertion that distinguishes claim-time exemption from implementation-time review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The guide says bugs are exempt from plan review at claim time so RCA can establish remediation shape.\n- [ ] The guide says complex bugs require plan review after RCA, once implementation plan and file impact exist, before implementation.\n- [ ] The guide does not imply every bug needs review before claim or that complex bug remediation is permanently exempt.\n- [ ] Focused bug-review tier tests and the documentation check pass.","id":"852a-1e41-632d-4087","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","priority":2,"tags":["janitor","documentation","governance","rp24"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Document bug claim exemption and post-RCA complex-bug plan review"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788313873989775001,"uuid":"c13ddc80-8106-4be1-8bc5-89691f9ebcc7"}